  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: (279 * 9) * 46 * 24 * (13 * 3)\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷, =, +, +, −**\n\nGiven: (279 * 9) * 46 * 24 * (13 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**279 ÷ 9**__ = 46 + 24 + 13 × 3\n\n⇒ 31 = 46 + 24 __**+ 39**__\n\n⇒ __**31 = 46 + 63**__\n\n⇒ 31 = 109\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) −, ×, =, −, ÷\n\nGiven: (279 * 9) * 46 * 24 * (13 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 279 − __**9 × 46**__ = 24 − __**13 ÷ 3**__\n\n⇒ __**270 × 46**__ = __**24 − 4.33**__\n\n⇒ 12420 = 19.67\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷, =, +, −, ×\n\nGiven: (279 * 9) * 46 * 24 * (13 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**279 ÷ 9**__ = 46 + 24 − (__**13 × 3**__)\n\n⇒ 31 = 46 + 24 − 39\n\n⇒ 31 = 31\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) ×, =, −, ÷, −\n\nGiven: (279 * 9) * 46 * 24 * (13 * 3)\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**279 × 9**__ = 46 − 24 ÷ (__**13 − 3**__)\n\n⇒ 2511 = 46 − __**24 ÷ 10**__\n\n⇒ 2511 = __**46 − 2.4**__\n\n⇒ 2511 ≠ 43.6\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
